<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">MY WORKSPACE</view><view class="title">让工作台，更适合你。</view><view class="subtitle">知班 · 班主任工作平台 · 本地体验版</view><view wx:if="error" class="warning">{{error}}</view>
 <view class="card"><view class="section">班级与学期</view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">教师称呼</text><input class="input" value="{{form.teacherName}}" data-field="teacherName" bindinput="input" maxlength="40"/></view><view class="field-row"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">班级名称</text><input class="input" value="{{form.className}}" data-field="className" bindinput="input" maxlength="60"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">学期名称</text><input class="input" value="{{form.termName}}" data-field="termName" bindinput="input" maxlength="60"/></view></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">学期起始日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{form.termStart}}" data-field="termStart" bindchange="input"><view class="picker">{{form.termStart}} ▾</view></picker><view class="form-note">用于计算校历周次。</view></view></view>
 <view class="card"><view class="section">班会记录提醒偏好</view><view class="field-row"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">提醒日期</text><picker range="{{weekdays}}" range-key="label" value="{{dayIndex}}" bindchange="day"><view class="picker">{{weekdays[dayIndex].label}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">提醒时间</text><picker mode="time" value="{{form.meetingReminderTime}}" data-field="meetingReminderTime" bindchange="input"><view class="picker">{{form.meetingReminderTime}} ▾</view></picker></view></view><view class="field-row"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">免打扰开始</text><picker mode="time" value="{{form.quietStart}}" data-field="quietStart" bindchange="input"><view class="picker">{{form.quietStart}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">免打扰结束</text><picker mode="time" value="{{form.quietEnd}}" data-field="quietEnd" bindchange="input"><view class="picker">{{form.quietEnd}} ▾</view></picker></view></view><view class="form-note">已记录本周主题后，工作台不再提示补录。以上设置保存偏好，微信定时推送尚未接入。</view></view><button class="primary" style="width:100%" bindtap="save">保存工作台设置</button>
 <view class="card"><view class="section">微信提醒接入状态</view><view class="warning">未连接发送后台 · 当前不会主动发送微信消息</view><view class="summary-copy">小程序订阅消息与公众号服务号提醒是两个接入渠道。此版本提供订阅授权入口；公众号关联和后台定时发送需要单独配置。</view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">小程序订阅消息模板 ID（公开标识）</text><input class="input" value="{{templateId}}" bindinput="template" placeholder="配置后可测试用户订阅授权" maxlength="100"/></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="subscribe">检查 / 申请本次订阅授权</button><view class="form-note">授权结果不代表提醒已发送。AppSecret 等服务端密钥不得填入小程序。</view></view>
 <view class="card"><view class="section">资料与备份</view><view class="summary-copy">资料保存在本机，未连接云端。更换设备、清理微信缓存或删除小程序可能造成资料丢失，请定期导出备份。学生资料使用代号，导出文件请妥善保存。</view><view class="actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="export">导出完整 JSON 备份</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="import">导入备份</button></view><view class="form-note">与网页版共用资料格式，可通过备份迁移。导入前会校验并请你确认替换。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section">每日关怀内容</view><view class="summary-copy">当前审核句库 {{quoteCount}} 句，已展示 {{shownQuotes}} 句。按本机展示历史优先选择未读内容，同一天保持同一句。内容库需要持续补充。</view></view><view class="actions"><button class="secondary half" bindtap="restoreDemo">恢复示例资料</button><button class="danger half" bindtap="clear">清空本机资料</button></view><view class="footer-note">知班 · 把日常整理好，把关心留下来。</view></view>
